WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.849 line:78%
 MY COLLEAGUE BRET BAIER TALKED

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.182 line:78%
WITH CONGRESSMAN MOEN EARLIER

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:16.916 line:78%
TODAY.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.385 line:78%
BACK FROM THE REGION WHICH HE

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:20.587 line:78%
SAID HE PAID FOR HIMSELF AND

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:21.021 line:78%
WITH THE HELP OF PRIVATE

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:21.788 line:78%
CONTRIBUTIONS.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.757 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: MIKE, THANK YOU.

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.891 line:78%
JOINING US NOW REPUBLICAN

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.425 line:78%
CONGRESSMAN MARK WANE MULLEN

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:31.564 line:78%
FROM OKLAHOMA.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:31.931 line:78%
JUST HAD AN INTERESTING TRIP

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.233 line:78%
OVERSEAS.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.067 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.768 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: START AT THE BEGINNING.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.503 line:78%
HOW DOES THIS START?

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.803 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WELL, I WANT TO MAKE IT VERY

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.772 line:78%
CLEAR.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.239 line:78%
I WASN'T LOOKING TO TRY TO GET

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.874 line:78%
IN AFGHANISTAN.

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.741 line:78%
THAT WASN'T WHAT WAS THIS THING

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:43.710 line:78%
STARTED OUT TO BE.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:45.478 line:78%
WHAT STARTED WAS PEOPLE STARTED

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.580 line:78%
CALLING ME WANTING HELP.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:49.449 line:78%
AND WE HAD BEEN GETTING FRIENDS

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.884 line:78%
OF MINE THAT WAS IN THE SERVICE

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.518 line:78%
THAT SAID CAN YOU HELP OUR

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.820 line:78%
INTERPRETER GET OUT?

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.454 line:78%
WHICH WE HAD A LOT OF

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.588 line:78%
CONVERSATIONS ABOUT THAT.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.357 line:78%
THEN WE STARTED GETTING PHONE

00:00:55.688 --> 00:01:00.193 line:78%
CALLS FROM PEOPLE THAT HAD

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:03.630 line:78%
FAMILY MEMBERS OR FRIENDS THAT

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:06.633 line:78%
WERE AMVETS OR AMERICAN CITIZENS

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:08.201 line:78%
AM SETS FOR SHORT.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.302 line:78%
LET ME MAKE A PHONE CALL IT CAME

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.438 line:78%
OUT THEY NEEDED A STATE

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:12.739 line:78%
DEPARTMENT OR A GOVERNMENT

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:13.039 line:78%
ENTITY TO SPONSOR THEIR FLIGHT

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.007 line:78%
GOING.

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.707 line:78%
IN THAT'S THE ONLY WAY THEY

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.009 line:78%
COULD GET IN.

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:16.342 line:78%
AND NO ONE WOULD SPONSOR THEIR

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:18.344 line:78%
FLIGHT.

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:22.015 line:78%
EVEN THOUGH IT WAS -- DESIGNATED

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:23.616 line:78%
TO GET THESE 20 AMERICANS OUT.

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:25.552 line:78%
AND SO THEY CALLED ME BACK AND

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:26.519 line:78%
SAID WOULD YOU BE INTERESTED IN

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:28.054 line:78%
SPAWRNG THE FLIGHT?

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.922 line:78%
AND I SAID I MEAN, WHAT DO YOU

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:31.458 line:78%
MEAN FINANCIALLY?

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:32.192 line:78%
AND THEY SAID NO,

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.927 line:78%
CONGRESSIONAL -- A CONGRESSMAN

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:36.196 line:78%
CAN SPONSOR A FLIGHT GOING IN

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:37.330 line:78%
AND IT GIVES ONE OF THESE OTHER

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:39.199 line:78%
DEPARTMENTS COVER BECAUSE IT'S

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:42.202 line:78%
KIND OF NO ONE WANTS TO TOUCH IT

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:43.169 line:78%
BECAUSE I PERSONALLY BELIEVE,

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.471 line:78%
BRET, IT WAS BECAUSE THEY KNEW

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:46.339 line:78%
THIS WAS A HOT NEST.

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:47.674 line:78%
THAT'S HOW THIS THING HOLE THING

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.741 line:78%
STARTED.

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.642 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: SO YOU DON'T ACTUALLY

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.176 line:78%
GET INTO AFGHANISTAN TO GET

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.078 line:78%
PEOPLE OUT?

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:54.547 line:78%
&gt;&gt; AS THIS THING MOVED FORWARD

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:55.682 line:78%
IS THEY WANTED -- EVERYBODY KEPT

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.283 line:78%
DENYING THEM AND THEN THEY ASKED

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:59.586 line:78%
WOULD YOU GO WITH US?

00:01:57.383 --> 00:02:02.889 line:78%
AND THESE ARE TIER 1 OPERATORS.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:03.289 line:78%
THESE ARE DELTA GUYS, SPECIAL

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:05.358 line:78%
FORCES.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:06.693 line:78%
THESE GUYS ARE LEGIT.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:09.195 line:78%
I'M NOBODY.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:09.996 line:78%
I'M JUST A CONGRESSMAN.

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:10.430 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU ARE A CONGRESSMAN

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.397 line:78%
FROM OKLAHOMA.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.966 line:78%
YOU ARE A BUSINESSMAN.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:13.800 line:78%
&gt;&gt; SURE.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.767 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: MIXED MARTIAL ARTS BACK

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.236 line:78%
GROUND BUT NO MILITARY, RIGHT?

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:16.536 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THAT DOESN'T PLAY WELL IN

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:17.770 line:78%
THIS.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.339 line:78%
I WASN'T TRYING TO GO OVER THERE

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:19.639 line:78%
AND BE A COWBOY OR ANYTHING LIKE

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:20.306 line:78%
THIS.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.708 line:78%
WHAT ELSE DO YOU DO?

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:25.145 line:78%
WHEN YOU SEE A PROBLEM, HOW DO

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:26.412 line:78%
YOU SAY NO IF YOU CAN BE AN

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:26.880 line:78%
ASSET THEY BELIEVED THINK COULD

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:28.948 line:78%
BE AN ASSET.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:30.483 line:78%
WE GOT A HUMANITARIAN FLIGHT

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:32.886 line:78%
PLAN FROM FAA.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:33.686 line:78%
AND EVERYTHING WAS GOOD TO GO.

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:34.954 line:78%
WE LEFT.

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:39.259 line:78%
WE HAD LEFT THE UNITED STATES.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:42.028 line:78%
WE HAD A TIME OF ARRIVAL IN THE

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:42.996 line:78%
KABUL WITH HIGH KIA THE AIRPORT

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.430 line:78%
THERE IN KABUL.

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:46.099 line:78%
WE GOT THERE AND ON APPROACH AND

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:47.600 line:78%
THEY CANCELED OUR PPR.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.701 line:78%
SO WE CIRCLED THE AIRPORT

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.704 line:78%
PROBABLY FOR AN HOUR.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:53.006 line:78%
AND WE HAD FIVE PPRs CANCELED.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:54.541 line:78%
EVERY TIME THEY CANCELED THE

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:56.843 line:78%
AGENCY THAT WAS TRYING TO GET US

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:58.077 line:78%
IN, WOULD GIVE US A NEW ONE.

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.746 line:78%
THEY ACTUALLY WENT INTO THE

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:01.414 line:78%
TOWER TO SAY LET THEM LAND.

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.748 line:78%
WE WERE ON THE PHONE WITH THEM

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:02.482 line:78%
TEXTING.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:04.017 line:78%
WE COULDN'T TALK.

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:05.885 line:78%
WE WERE TEXTING BACK AND FORTH

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.152 line:78%
AND THEY KEPT ISSUING US A NEW

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:08.655 line:78%
ONE.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.055 line:78%
AND THEY WOULD NEVER LET US IN

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:10.924 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN.

00:03:09.155 --> 00:03:13.493 line:78%
I WILL TELL YOU THIS, TOO.

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:14.460 line:78%
UNFORTUNATELY, ONE OF OUR

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.095 line:78%
AMERICAN CITIZENS HER 2-YEAR-OLD

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:19.265 line:78%
SON AND I BELIEVE IT WAS HER

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.567 line:78%
FATHER TO WHICH I HAD PASSPORTS

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:23.670 line:78%
ON WE LOST CONTACT ON BECAUSE

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:25.872 line:78%
THEY WERE AT THE ABBEY GATE AND

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:26.406 line:78%
A FEW HOURS LATER THE ABBEY GATE

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:27.407 line:78%
BLEW UP.

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:28.141 line:78%
WE HAVEN'T HAD ANY CONTACT WITH

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:29.142 line:78%
THEM SINCE.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:29.943 line:78%
I BELIEVE IT'S BECAUSE THEY WERE

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:31.811 line:78%
CAUGHT UP IN THAT.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:33.713 line:78%
SO WHAT THEY DID BY PLAYING

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:34.047 line:78%
POLITICS ON THAT, FOR WHATEVER

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:34.847 line:78%
REASON.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:35.915 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: SO YOU DON'T KNOW WHO

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:38.184 line:78%
SHUT YOU DOWN FROM LANDING?

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:38.718 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW WHO SHUT US

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:40.453 line:78%
DOWN.

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:41.721 line:78%
BUT I THINK IT WAS 100 PERCENT

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:42.121 line:78%
DIRECTED FROM THE STATE

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.890 line:78%
DEPARTMENT.

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:44.424 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: AT SOME POINT YOU GO ON

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.158 line:78%
TO TAJIKISTAN.

00:03:44.757 --> 00:03:47.560 line:78%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:48.228 line:78%
I NEVER WENT TO TAJIKISTAN.

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:49.596 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: DIDN'T GO IN?

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:51.598 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THAT IS ABSOLUTELY FALSE.

00:03:49.796 --> 00:03:55.635 line:78%
WE DID WORK AROUND THE REGION.

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:57.270 line:78%
BUT TAJIKISTAN WAS UNFORTUNATELY

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:58.338 line:78%
THE AMBASSADOR WAS NOT HELPFUL

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:00.473 line:78%
AT ALL.

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:02.008 line:78%
AND A LOT OF MISINFORMATION WAS

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:03.109 line:78%
GOING OUT ABOUT THAT.

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:06.346 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: AND FOR THE STORY LINE

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:07.447 line:78%
THAT SAID THAT YOU POSSIBLY

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:10.149 line:78%
INTERRUPTED SOME COVERT THING

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:10.850 line:78%
THAT WAS GOING ON OR SOME

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.584 line:78%
SEPARATION TAJIKISTAN?

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:13.953 line:78%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:15.488 line:78%
I DON'T -- I DIDN'T HAVE A CLUE

00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:17.557 line:78%
WHAT THEY'RE TALKING ABOUT.

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:17.857 line:78%
THIS IS WHAT THE AMBASSADOR TOLD

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:19.993 line:78%
ME.

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:21.361 line:78%
HE SAID IT'S VERY SENSITIVE

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:22.729 line:78%
RIGHT NOW MARK WAYNE.

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:25.465 line:78%
IT'S PUTIN AND THE CHINESE

00:04:22.829 --> 00:04:25.898 line:78%
GOVERNMENT IS GOING TO BE HERE

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:26.633 line:78%
SEPTEMBER 5TH.

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:28.701 line:78%
IT'S VERY SENSITIVE.

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:29.068 line:78%
I SAID I GET IT'S VERY

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:30.803 line:78%
SENSITIVE.

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:32.005 line:78%
I DON'T NEED YOUR ASSETS.

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:33.439 line:78%
I FIRST OF ALL WAS MAKING YOU

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.941 line:78%
AWAY THAT WE'RE COME IN.

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:36.643 line:78%
I ALSO AND I ALSO MADE THE POINT

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:38.745 line:78%
I SAID BUT WE ARE COMING IN WITH

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:39.812 line:78%
A LARGE SUM OF CASH.

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:40.913 line:78%
WHY ARE YOU COMING WITH A LARGE

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:42.782 line:78%
SUM OF CASH?

00:04:41.014 --> 00:04:44.250 line:78%
SIR, DO YOU KNOW THAT WE GOT TO

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:48.087 line:78%
GO THROUGH 16 CHECKPOINTS JUST

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:50.690 line:78%
TO GET FROM KABUL TO -- EACH ONE

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:51.024 line:78%
OF THOSE CHARGE SOMEONE TO COME

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:51.624 line:78%
THROUGH.

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:52.458 line:78%
I DON'T KNOW WHAT THE

00:04:51.724 --> 00:04:53.459 line:78%
REQUIREMENTS ARE.

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:54.327 line:78%
WHAT ARE THE REQUIREMENTS OF

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:56.362 line:78%
BRINGING THIS CASH?

00:04:54.427 --> 00:04:57.463 line:78%
AND HE SAYS I CAN'T ASSIST YOU.

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:57.730 line:78%
I CAN'T HELP YOU.

00:04:57.563 --> 00:05:00.533 line:78%
WHY?

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:02.068 line:78%
I WAS TOLD NOT TO.

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:02.568 line:78%
YOU WERE TOLD NOT TO HELP AN

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:04.904 line:78%
AMERICAN CITIZEN?

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:07.440 line:78%
YOU WERE TOLD BY THE FEDERAL

00:05:05.004 --> 00:05:08.708 line:78%
GOVERNMENT IN WASHINGTON, D.C.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.943 line:78%
NOT TO HELP WHEN WE'RE NOT

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:13.212 line:78%
TRYING TO SMUGGLE ANYBODY OVER.

00:05:11.044 --> 00:05:15.348 line:78%
WE'RE TRYING TO DO A JOB THAT

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:16.449 line:78%
PRESIDENT BIDEN WOULDN'T DO.

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:17.283 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU KNOW, A LOT OF

00:05:16.549 --> 00:05:19.052 line:78%
PEOPLE LOOK AT WHAT YOU WERE

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:20.586 line:78%
TRYING TO DO AS ADMIRABLE.

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:22.021 line:78%
YOU HAD HOUSE MINORITY LEADER

00:05:20.687 --> 00:05:25.758 line:78%
KEVIN McCARTHY SAYING HE

00:05:22.121 --> 00:05:28.328 line:78%
REALLY DIDN'T WANT MEMBERS DOING

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:29.262 line:78%
THIS ON THEIR OWN BECAUSE ONE,

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:29.996 line:78%
THEY COULD PROXIMATE CAUSE

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:31.464 line:78%
HOSTAGES.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:32.432 line:78%
TWO, THEY COULD BECOME PROBLEMS

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:33.700 line:78%
THAT THE MILITARY WOULD HAVE TO

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:34.067 line:78%
DEAL WITH.

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:35.001 line:78%
&gt;&gt; SURE.

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:36.369 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: DO YOU THINK ABOUT THAT

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:37.970 line:78%
WHETHER THAT WAS WORTH IT.

00:05:36.536 --> 00:05:39.939 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I DID.

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:41.641 line:78%
BUT, HOW DO YOU SAY NO?

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:43.543 line:78%
I MEAN, HOW DO YOU SAY NO WHEN

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:44.210 line:78%
YOU HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY TO DO

00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:45.511 line:78%
SOMETHING.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.646 line:78%
BELIEVE ME MY HAPPY WASN'T HAPPY

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:47.246 line:78%
ABOUT ME GOING.

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:49.248 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: I'M SURE.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.049 line:78%
&gt;&gt; MY KID WASN'T HAPPY WITH ME

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:51.184 line:78%
ABOUT GOING.

00:05:50.149 --> 00:05:52.752 line:78%
QUITE FRANKLY WITH ALL OF YOU

00:05:51.284 --> 00:05:54.887 line:78%
ALL OF US ON THAT PLANE WE FELT

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:56.222 line:78%
LIKE WE PROBABLY HAD A 50/50

00:05:54.987 --> 00:05:57.590 line:78%
CHANCE OF COMING BACK.

00:05:56.389 --> 00:06:00.626 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: I ACTUALLY THINK THIS

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:02.028 line:78%
WAS BRAVADO TESTOSTERONE OR

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:05.131 line:78%
EFFORT TO GET THE SPOTLIGHT.

00:06:02.362 --> 00:06:05.932 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:06:05.298 --> 00:06:06.232 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: HOW DO YOU RESPOND TO

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:08.301 line:78%
THAT.

00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:08.634 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I NEVER PRETENDED TO BE

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:10.002 line:78%
RAMBEAU.

00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:10.336 line:78%
WE WERE SURROUNDED BY GREAT

00:06:10.103 --> 00:06:12.505 line:78%
PEOPLE.

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:15.575 line:78%
OF ALL THE GUYS I'M WORKING WITH

00:06:12.605 --> 00:06:15.875 line:78%
I'M THE LOW MAN ON THE TOTEM

00:06:15.675 --> 00:06:17.777 line:78%
POLE.

00:06:15.975 --> 00:06:20.780 line:78%
THEY FELT I COULD BE OF

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:22.148 line:78%
ASSISTANCE TO THEM.

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:23.416 line:78%
HOW?

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:25.151 line:78%
LOGISTICALLY MAYBE MAKE PHONE

00:06:23.516 --> 00:06:30.890 line:78%
CALLS AND BEING ABLE TO TAKE IN

00:06:25.685 --> 00:06:32.091 line:78%
THE SIVs OR THE AMSITS AS THEY

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.059 line:78%
CAME ON THE PLANE.

00:06:32.191 --> 00:06:34.594 line:78%
THAT WAS THE PLAN.

00:06:33.159 --> 00:06:35.928 line:78%
THAT PLAN CHANGED AND IT CHANGED

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:36.662 line:78%
WHEN WE WASN'T ALLOWED TO GET

00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:39.298 line:78%
INTO AFGHANISTAN.

00:06:36.763 --> 00:06:41.300 line:78%
WE QUICKLY REALIZED THAT THE

